<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="eyebrow">GOOD BUSINESS GROWS TOGETHER</view><view class="heading-title">把好生意，分享给好伙伴</view><view class="subtitle">邀请成功入驻的商户，将首次绑定到当前代理。</view><view class="invite-card" style="margin-top:40rpx"><view class="title">{{agent.name}}</view><view class="desc" style="margin-top:20rpx">诚邀你一起，让好生意发生</view><view class="code" style="word-break:break-all;font-size:30rpx">{{inviteCode}}</view><view class="desc">商户入驻时填写以上邀请码<view class="line-break"></view>失效邀请码会提示错误，不自动变更归属</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="copyInvite">复制邀请码</button><view class="mock-note">此为文字邀请码演示，不伪造二维码。<view class="line-break"></view>商户已有归属时，需平台审批后才能接管。</view></block></view>